{"id": "c01", "cat": "conflict", "text": "卵を一番下にして、その上に水を載せて。", "items": {"egg": 1, "water": 1}, "constraints": [["layer", ["egg", "bottom"]], ["on", ["water", "egg"]]], "expect": "clarify"}
